        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Kled's next Attack grants <span>150% Attack Speed</span> for four Attacks or 4 seconds.<br /><br />The fourth hit deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">20/30/40/50/60 plus (4.5/5/5.5/6/6.5% + (0.02% bonus Attack Damage) + (0.004% bonus Health)) max Health physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Max Health damage is capped at <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">200 physical damage</span> against monsters.<br />While on Cooldown, Attacks reduce this Ability's Cooldown by 0.5 second(s). Against Champions, this Cooldown reduction is increased to 1.5 second(s).</span>",
