        "tooltip": "Kled charges toward an area, leaving a trail that grants allies increasing <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span>. While charging and for 2 seconds after Kled gains up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(200/300/400 + (300% bonus Attack Damage)) Shield</span>. Skaarl rams the first enemy champion encountered, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(4/6/8% + (0.03% bonus Attack Damage))</span> to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(12/18/24% + (0.09% bonus Attack Damage)) max Health magic damage</span> (based on distance travelled) and briefly <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Back</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The damage, <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span>, and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shield</span> reach their max values after 3 second(s) of charging.<br /></span>",
